HST Office: entering a pivot table shows its contextual tab without opening it.

As in Office, the cursor in a pivot table shows Sheets' PivotTable Analyze tab (context-Pivot) beside
the current tab instead of switching to it, like the other selection contexts.

- vcl/source/control/tabctrl.cxx.

--- a/vcl/source/control/tabctrl.cxx
+++ b/vcl/source/control/tabctrl.cxx
@@ -2239,6 +2239,7 @@
         case vcl::EnumContext::Context::ThreeDObject:
         case vcl::EnumContext::Context::MultiObject:
         case vcl::EnumContext::Context::Form:
+        case vcl::EnumContext::Context::Pivot: // Office shows PivotTable Analyze without opening it
             return true;
         default:
             return false;
